---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="No analytics, no tracking, no cookies on this site. The only opt-in data collection is InstallerClean's Send result log button, with the full payload visible before sending."
>
  <article class="page">
    <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lead">I am in favour of it.</p>

      <p>
        I don't collect anything from visitors to this site. No analytics, no tracking, no
        cookies. Who you are and what you read here are none of my business.
      </p>

      <p>
        The one bit of information I do collect: <a href="/installerclean">InstallerClean</a> has
        a completely optional "Send result log" button that users can press after a clean. When pressed, the app sends a small JSON file to this
        site with counts and categorical labels: bytes freed, success or failure, app version,
        that sort of thing. No file paths, no usernames, no IP addresses. I read those in
        aggregate to see whether the app is working. The button shows you exactly what's about
        to be sent before you press it.
      </p>

      <p>That's it.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-16) var(--space-6);
  }
  .glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 40vh;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: var(--hero-glow);
  }
  .inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .lead {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
</style>
